    {
      "id": "p1",
      "text": "The region faces a significant power shortfall after a grid incident triggered a protective response. A power unit experienced a sudden shutdown, leading the grid operator to issue a red alert. In response, emergency measures were implemented to prevent system collapse, including load shedding for grid stability. The result is a large-scale power deficit affecting the community.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Innocent",
        "fragments": [
          "why-0",
          "how-1",
          "how-2",
          "result-0"
        ],
        "center": "result-0",
        "channel": "toned",
        "channel_role": "toned",
        "composition_mode": "ADR-0008"
      },
      "warnings": [],
      "fit": 0.75
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "From its operational standpoint, the affected power unit—now a failed component seeking repair—experienced an unforeseen mechanical failure. This sudden operational interruption, amid increased demand due to heat, strained the energy infrastructure. The trusted grid guardian then issued a protective warning and implemented emergency measures to prevent system collapse.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Innocent",
        "fragments": [
          "why-0",
          "why-2",
          "how-1",
          "how-2"
        ],
        "center": "who-1",
        "channel": "focalized",
        "channel_role": "focalized",
        "composition_mode": "ADR-0008",
        "focal": "who-1"
      },
      "warnings": [],
      "fit": 0.65
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "text": "The powerless suppliers, eleven generators affected by the outage, now see their capacity severely reduced. This energy asset situation stems from a grid incident and extreme weather that strained the system. A power shortage of more than 950 megawatts has left the region in need of stability.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Innocent",
